---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContentProvenance from '../../components/ContentProvenance.astro';
import { pythonLabTemplates, PYODIDE_VERSION } from '../../lib/python-lab';
---
<BaseLayout title="免安装 Python 小实验" description="用真实 Python WebAssembly 在浏览器练习 CSV 检查与轴杆基础公式，明确记录环境、输出与未验证范围。" flush>
  <section class="lab-hero"><div class="container-wide lab-hero-grid"><div><nav aria-label="当前位置"><a href="/learning/">学习路径</a><span> / </span>Python 小实验</nav><span class="lab-eyebrow">WRITE · RUN · CHECK</span><h1>把第一段 Python，<br /><em>变成看得见的输出。</em></h1><p>从一份 CSV、几行公式开始。编辑后明确运行，观察真实输出，再把代码、输入和结果带走。</p><div class="lab-hero-links"><a href="#python-workbench">开始小实验 ↓</a><a href="/downloads/python-lab/README.md">下载到本机运行 →</a></div><small>教学模板 · AI 辅助编写 · 待本人复核</small></div><aside class="lab-runtime-card"><span>IN YOUR BROWSER</span><strong>Python · 真实解释器</strong><div class="lab-code-visual" aria-hidden="true"><span>&gt;&gt;&gt; import csv</span><span>&gt;&gt;&gt; print(2 + 2)</span><b>4</b><i>下一项：检查输入，而非猜测结果。</i></div><p>Pyodide {PYODIDE_VERSION} / WebAssembly<br />每次运行创建独立 WebWorker</p><small>示意代码与预期输出；你的实际运行结果显示在下方。</small></aside></div></section>
  <div class="container-wide lab-content">
    <div class="lab-guidance"><div><b>01 / 改代码与输入</b><p>输入区作为字符串 <code>input_text</code> 传入，不会拼接成代码。</p></div><div><b>02 / 登录后明确运行</b><p>首次仅从本站加载约 13.5 MB；代码执行限时 8 秒，随时可停止。</p></div><div><b>03 / 核对再导出</b><p>本页不自动保存、不上传代码到服务器或 AI，也不更新学习状态。</p></div></div>
    <section id="python-workbench" class="lab-workbench" data-python-lab data-lab-state="idle" aria-labelledby="lab-title">
      <div class="lab-workbench-heading"><div><span class="lab-eyebrow">TWO SMALL EXPERIMENTS</span><h2 id="lab-title">Python 小实验台</h2></div><span class="lab-session-label">当前页面内存 · 关闭即离开</span></div>
      <div class="lab-template-row"><label for="lab-template">选择起点<select id="lab-template">{pythonLabTemplates.map(item => <option value={item.id}>{item.title}</option>)}</select></label><button type="button" class="lab-button lab-button-quiet" data-lab-load-template>载入模板</button><p data-lab-template-description>{pythonLabTemplates[0].description}</p></div>
      <div class="lab-editors"><div class="lab-editor"><div class="lab-editor-label"><label for="lab-code">Python 代码</label><button type="button" data-lab-export="code">导出 .py ↓</button></div><textarea id="lab-code" rows="22" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" autocorrect="off" aria-describedby="lab-editor-help">{pythonLabTemplates[0].code}</textarea></div><div class="lab-editor"><div class="lab-editor-label"><label for="lab-input">输入文本 <code>input_text</code></label><button type="button" data-lab-export="input">导出输入 ↓</button></div><textarea id="lab-input" rows="13" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" autocorrect="off">{pythonLabTemplates[0].input}</textarea><div class="lab-input-note"><b>先试一处可观察的改变</b><p>CSV：把 <code>100</code> 改成 <code>abc</code>，观察行号与错误说明。轴杆：只改力的符号，核对位移与反力。</p><p id="lab-editor-help">代码与输入各限 64,000 字符。编辑器使用普通文本框；Tab 移到下一控件，缩进请用空格。只运行你理解的教学代码。</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="lab-controls"><button type="button" class="lab-button" data-lab-run>运行 Python ▶</button><button type="button" class="lab-button lab-button-quiet" data-lab-stop disabled>停止运行 ■</button><button type="button" class="lab-button lab-button-quiet" data-lab-export="result" disabled>导出本次结果 JSON ↓</button></div>
      <p class="lab-status" data-lab-status role="status" aria-live="polite">尚未运行。匿名可编辑与导出；登录核对通过后才加载 Python 运行环境。</p><a class="lab-login" data-lab-login href="/login" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hidden>在新标签登录，再返回本页运行 ↗</a>
      <p class="lab-environment"><span class="lab-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span data-lab-environment>尚未加载运行环境</span></p>
      <div class="lab-outputs"><div><h3>标准输出 <code>stdout</code></h3><pre data-lab-stdout tabindex="0" aria-label="Python 标准输出">（暂无标准输出）</pre><p data-lab-value class="lab-value"></p></div><div><h3>错误输出 <code>stderr</code></h3><pre data-lab-stderr tabindex="0" aria-label="Python 错误输出">（暂无错误输出）</pre></div></div>
      <div class="lab-fallback" data-lab-fallback hidden><b>当前未完成站内运行，仍可继续练习。</b><p>下载代码与输入，在你自己的 Python 3 环境按说明运行；本机结果需要你实际执行后另行记录。本站没有把这次失败记为完成。</p><a href="/downloads/python-lab/README.md">查看本机运行命令 →</a><a href="/downloads/python-lab/python-lab.zip" download>下载完整练习包 ↓</a></div>
      <noscript><p class="lab-fallback">此实验台需要 JavaScript 和 WebAssembly。仍可<a href="/downloads/python-lab/python-lab.zip" download>下载 Python 练习包</a>在本机运行。</p></noscript>
    </section>
    <div class="lab-footnotes"><section><span class="lab-eyebrow">BOUNDARIES BEFORE RESULTS</span><h2>运行环境与适用边界</h2><ul><li>这是浏览器中的真实 Python，不是服务器 Python、用户本机 Python 或 ANSYS 运行。基础轴杆模板只算一维线弹性公式，不是有限元求解器。</li><li>仅提供已附带标准库；不自动安装 NumPy、pandas 或其他包，不提供 <code>input()</code> 交互。标准输出和错误分别保留至 32,000 字符，表达式返回值保留至 4,000 字符；截断会明确标注，过量输出会停止。</li><li>Python 不接收账户信息；默认不暴露 JavaScript 全局对象，运行环境加载后禁用常见网络与子 Worker 接口。这些限制不是恶意代码安全沙箱，请勿粘贴不可信代码或敏感资料。</li><li>代码和输入不写入本地存储、不自动保存、不上传给本站或 AI。浏览器仍会向本站请求登录状态与运行文件；运行文件可能被浏览器缓存。修改后需手动导出；刷新会丢失编辑。</li><li>手机上可编辑与阅读，首次加载耗流量。无网、浏览器不支持或运行超时均会显示实际失败，不产生成功记录。</li></ul></section><aside><h2>从输出回到知识</h2><a href="/domains/tools/kp/file-io/">文件、字符串与读取 →</a><a href="/domains/tools/kp/error-handling/">理解真实报错 →</a><a href="/learning/projects/linear-static/">进入线性静力验证项目 →</a><a href="/downloads/python-lab/README.md">本机练习包、版本与核对范围 →</a><p>参考接口实际核对：<a href="https://pyodide.org/en/314.0.7/usage/webworker.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">官方 Worker 文档</a>、<a href="https://pyodide.org/en/314.0.7/usage/api/js-api.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">JavaScript API</a>。模板待人工复核；首次展示不代表用户已经运行。</p></aside></div>
    <ContentProvenance contentId="lab:python" />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
<script>import '../../scripts/python-lab';</script>
<style>
  .lab-hero{background:#091f2d;color:#c7d8df;padding:3rem 0 3.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid #244354}.lab-hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .8fr;gap:4rem;align-items:center}.lab-hero nav{font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:2rem}.lab-hero a{color:#8edbce}.lab-eyebrow{font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-accent)}.lab-hero .lab-eyebrow{color:#5ad6c6}.lab-hero h1{color:#f5fafb;font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4.4vw,3.6rem);margin:1rem 0 1.35rem;line-height:1.2}.lab-hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#77decf}.lab-hero p{max-width:36rem;line-height:1.9}.lab-hero small{display:block;font-size:.75rem;color:#9eb8c3}.lab-hero-links{display:flex;gap:1.8rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:1.5rem 0}.lab-runtime-card{padding:2rem;border:1px solid #315263;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#123446,#0a2535);border-radius:20px}.lab-runtime-card>span{font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#84acb8}.lab-runtime-card strong{display:block;font-size:1.5rem;color:white;margin:.5rem 0}.lab-code-visual{font-family:var(--font-mono);padding:1.25rem 0;border-top:1px solid #33515f;border-bottom:1px solid #33515f;margin:1.25rem 0;display:grid;gap:.4rem}.lab-code-visual b{color:#68ddbb}.lab-code-visual i{font-style:normal;font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:.7rem;color:#91adba;margin-top:.7rem}.lab-content{padding-top:2rem;padding-bottom:4rem}.lab-guidance{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem}.lab-guidance b{color:var(--color-primary);font-size:.85rem}.lab-guidance p{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin:.4rem 0}.lab-workbench{background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:18px;padding:2rem;scroll-margin-top:90px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);min-width:0}.lab-workbench-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem}.lab-workbench h2{font-size:1.8rem;margin:.4rem 0 1.5rem}.lab-session-label{font-size:.7rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}.lab-template-row{display:flex;align-items:end;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:1.5rem}.lab-template-row label{font-size:.8rem;display:grid;gap:.4rem}.lab-template-row select{background:var(--color-surface-soft);color:var(--color-text);border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:6px;padding:.65rem;max-width:100%;font:inherit}.lab-template-row p{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin:0;flex-basis:100%}.lab-editors{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.35fr 1fr;gap:1.25rem;min-width:0}.lab-editor{min-width:0}.lab-editor-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.6rem}.lab-editor-label label{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700}.lab-editor-label button{border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--color-accent);font-size:.72rem;cursor:pointer;min-height:36px;white-space:nowrap}.lab-editor textarea{display:block;width:100%;resize:vertical;min-height:14rem;max-height:65rem;background:var(--color-code-bg);color:var(--color-text);border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:8px;padding:1rem;font:12px/1.7 var(--font-mono);tab-size:4;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;box-sizing:border-box}.lab-editor textarea:focus{outline:2px solid var(--color-accent);outline-offset:2px}.lab-editor textarea[readonly]{opacity:.75}.lab-input-note{font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.8;padding:1rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}.lab-input-note b{color:var(--color-text)}.lab-input-note p{margin-top:.5rem}.lab-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.7rem;margin:1.5rem 0 .9rem}.lab-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:44px;border:1px solid var(--color-accent);border-radius:6px;background:var(--color-accent);color:var(--color-surface);padding:.65rem 1rem;font:600 .8rem var(--font-body);cursor:pointer}.lab-button-quiet{background:transparent;color:var(--color-text);border-color:var(--color-border)}.lab-button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}.lab-button:focus-visible,.lab-editor-label button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-accent);outline-offset:3px}.lab-status{font-size:.85rem;min-height:1.7rem;color:var(--color-text);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.lab-login{display:block;font-size:.85rem;margin-top:.5rem}.lab-login[hidden],.lab-fallback[hidden]{display:none}.lab-environment{font:11px/1.8 var(--font-mono);color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin:1rem 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.lab-dot{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--color-accent);border-radius:50%;margin-right:.5rem}.lab-outputs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.25rem;min-width:0}.lab-outputs>div{min-width:0}.lab-outputs h3{font-size:.8rem;margin:0 0 .65rem}.lab-outputs h3 code{color:var(--color-text-secondary);font-size:.7rem}.lab-outputs pre{font:12px/1.8 var(--font-mono);color:var(--color-text);background:var(--color-code-bg);border:1px solid var(--color-border);padding:1rem;border-radius:8px;min-height:10rem;max-height:25rem;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin:0}.lab-value{font-size:.8rem;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:var(--color-accent);margin-top:.6rem}.lab-fallback{padding:1rem 1.25rem;background:var(--color-warning-bg);color:var(--color-warning-text);border:1px solid var(--color-warning-border);border-radius:8px;font-size:.82rem;margin-top:1.25rem}.lab-fallback p{margin:.5rem 0}.lab-fallback a{margin-right:1.5rem;color:inherit;text-decoration:underline}.lab-footnotes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:3rem;margin-top:3rem}.lab-footnotes h2{font-size:1.35rem;margin:.6rem 0 1rem}.lab-footnotes ul{padding-left:1.25rem;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.9}.lab-footnotes li{margin-bottom:.7rem}.lab-footnotes aside>a{display:block;font-size:.85rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border);padding:.8rem 0}.lab-footnotes aside p{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-top:1rem}.lab-workbench code,.lab-guidance code{font-size:.9em;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  @media(max-width:850px){.lab-hero-grid{gap:2rem;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.lab-editors{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lab-editor textarea{font-size:13px}#lab-code{min-height:22rem}.lab-footnotes{gap:2rem}.lab-session-label{display:none}}
  @media(max-width:600px){.lab-hero{padding:2rem 0}.lab-hero-grid,.lab-footnotes{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lab-runtime-card{padding:1.3rem}.lab-hero nav{margin-bottom:1.5rem}.lab-guidance{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.8rem}.lab-guidance p{margin:.2rem 0}.lab-workbench{padding:1rem;border-radius:12px}.lab-outputs{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lab-workbench h2{font-size:1.5rem}.lab-template-row label{flex:1;min-width:0}.lab-controls{gap:.5rem}.lab-button{padding:.65rem .8rem;min-height:44px}.lab-editor textarea{padding:.75rem}.lab-footnotes{gap:1rem;margin-top:2rem}.lab-hero-links{gap:1rem}}
</style>
